msgstr "Ali"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_pages.html.twig:73
msgid "External URL"
msgstr "Zunanji URL"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_pages.html.twig:73
msgid ""
"Enter the URL that the user will be redirected to instead of displaying the "
"content defined in the previous field. Setting this option disables editing "
"of the page body."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite URL, na katerega bo uporabnik preusmerjen namesto prikaza vsebine, "
"določene v prejšnjem polju. Nastavitev te možnosti onemogoči urejanje telesa "
"strani."

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_pages.html.twig:78
msgid "Use a valid external URL"
msgstr "Uporabite veljaven zunanji URL"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:15
msgid "Pages"
msgstr "Strani"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:20
msgid "Enable the \"Legal Information\" page"
msgstr "Omogočite stran »Pravne informacije«"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:26
msgid "Enable the \"Terms of Service\" page"
msgstr "Omogočite stran »Pogoji storitve«"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:32
msgid "Enable the \"Privacy Policy\" page"
msgstr "Omogočite stran »Politika zasebnosti«"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:39
msgid "Move links in the \"Public pages\" menu"
msgstr "Premaknite povezave v meniju »Javne strani«"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:39
msgid ""
"Links are added by default in the footer. Enable this option if you want to "
"move them in the \"Public pages\" menu."
msgstr ""
"Povezave so privzeto dodane v nogo. Omogočite to možnost, če jih želite "
"premakniti v meniju »Javne strani«."

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:45
msgid "Fallback language for untranslated pages"
msgstr "Nadomestni jezik za neprevedene strani"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:59
msgid "Consent Manager Platform"
msgstr "Platforma Consent Manager"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:64
msgid "Enable the consent manager"
msgstr "Omogoči upravitelja soglasja"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:64
msgid ""
"If you enable this option, you must define which services should be included "
"in the consent manager. Read the plugin documentation to learn how to do "
"this."
msgstr ""
"Če omogočite to možnost, morate določiti, katere storitve naj bodo vključene "
"v upravitelja soglasij. Preberite dokumentacijo vtičnika, če želite "
"izvedeti, kako to storiti."

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:71
msgid "Hide the \"Accept all\" button"
msgstr "Skrij gumb \"Sprejmi vse\""

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:71
#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:78
msgid ""
"Do not enable this option if you need to comply with the european "
"legislation (GDPR & ePrivacy)."
msgstr ""
"Ne omogočite te možnosti, če morate biti v skladu z evropsko zakonodajo "
"(GDPR & ePrivacy)."

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:78
msgid "Hide the \"I decline\" button"
msgstr "Skrij gumb \"Zavračam\""

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:85
msgid "Enable \"localStorage\""
msgstr "Omogoči \"localStorage\""

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:85
msgid ""
"By default, consent information is stored in the browser with a cookie. "
"Enable this option if you want to use \"locaStorage\" instead."
msgstr ""
"Podatki o soglasju so privzeto shranjeni v brskalniku s piškotkom. Omogočite "
"to možnost, če želite namesto tega uporabiti \"locaStorage\"."

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:93
msgid "Cookie lifetime"
msgstr "Življenjska doba piškotka"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:93
msgid ""
"Specify the maximum lifetime of the cookie used to store consent information "
"in the browser (in days). After this period, the user's consent will be "
"requested again."
msgstr ""
"Določite najdaljšo življenjsko dobo piškotka, ki se uporablja za "
"shranjevanje informacij o soglasju v brskalniku (v dnevih). Po preteku tega "
"obdobja bo uporabnik ponovno zahteval soglasje."

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:101
msgid "Cookie domain"
msgstr "Domena piškotkov"

#: ../templates/default/legalnotices_settings.html.twig:101
msgid ""
"Use this if you want to get consent once for multiple matching domains. By "
"default, the current domain is used."
msgstr ""
"To uporabite, če želite enkrat pridobiti soglasje za več ujemajočih se "
"domen. Privzeto se uporablja trenutna domena."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:35
msgid ""
"The consent manager could not be loaded. It may have been blocked by an ad "
"blocker."
msgstr ""
"Upravitelja soglasij ni bilo mogoče naložiti. Morda ga je blokiral program "
"za blokiranje oglasov."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:56
msgid "Services we would like to use"
msgstr "Storitve, ki jih želimo uporabljati"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:57
msgid ""
"Here you can assess and customize the services that we'd like to use on this "
"website. You're in charge! Enable or disable services as you see fit."
msgstr ""
"Tukaj lahko ocenite in prilagodite storitve, ki jih želimo uporabljati na "
"tem spletnem mestu. Ti si glavni! Omogočite ali onemogočite storitve, kot se "
"vam zdi primerno."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:60
msgid "Testing mode!"
msgstr "Testni način!"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:61
msgid "There were changes since your last visit, please renew your consent."
msgstr ""
"Od vašega zadnjega obiska je prišlo do sprememb, prosimo obnovite vaše "
"soglasje."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:62
msgid ""
"Hi! Could we please enable some additional services for {purposes}? You can "
"always change or withdraw your consent later."
msgstr ""
"zdravo Ali lahko omogočimo nekaj dodatnih storitev za {namene}? Svoje "
"soglasje lahko pozneje kadar koli spremenite ali prekličete."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:63
msgid "Let me choose"
msgstr "Naj izberem"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:67
msgid "Service Provision"
msgstr "Zagotavljanje storitev"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:68
msgid ""
"These services are essential for the correct functioning of this website. "
"You cannot disable them here as the service would not work correctly "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Te storitve so bistvenega pomena za pravilno delovanje te spletne strani. "
"Tukaj jih ne morete onemogočiti, saj drugače storitev ne bi delovala "
"pravilno."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:71
msgid "Performance Optimization"
msgstr "Optimizacija zmogljivosti"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:72
msgid ""
"These services process personal information to optimize the service that "
"this website offers."
msgstr ""
"Te storitve obdelujejo osebne podatke za optimizacijo storitve, ki jo ponuja "
"to spletno mesto."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:75
msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "Analitika"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:76
msgid ""
"These services process personal information to let us know how you use this "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Te storitve obdelujejo osebne podatke, da nam sporočijo, kako uporabljate to "
"spletno mesto."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:79
msgid "Marketing"
msgstr "Trženje"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:80
msgid ""
"These services process personal information to show you relevant content "
"about products, services or topics that you might be interested in."
msgstr ""
"Te storitve obdelujejo osebne podatke, da vam prikažejo ustrezno vsebino o "
"izdelkih, storitvah ali temah, ki bi vas utegnile zanimati."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:83
msgid "Advertising"
msgstr "Oglaševanje"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:84
msgid ""
"These services process personal information to show you personalized or "
"interest-based advertisements."
msgstr ""
"Te storitve obdelujejo osebne podatke, da vam prikažejo prilagojene oglase "
"ali oglase, ki temeljijo na zanimanju."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:88
msgid "service"
msgstr "storitev"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:89
msgid "services"
msgstr "storitve"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:91
msgid "That's ok"
msgstr "To je v redu"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:92
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Shrani"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:93
msgid "I decline"
msgstr "Zavračam"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:94
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Zapri"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:95
msgid "Accept all"
msgstr "Sprejmi vse"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:96
msgid "Accept selected"
msgstr "Sprejmi izbrano"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:99
msgid "privacy policy"
msgstr "politiko zasebnosti"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:100
msgid "To learn more, please read our {privacyPolicy}."
msgstr "Če želite izvedeti več, preberite našo {politiko zasebnosti}."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:104
msgid "Enable or disable all services"
msgstr "Omogočite ali onemogočite vse storitve"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:105
msgid "Use this switch to enable or disable all services."
msgstr "S tem stikalom omogočite ali onemogočite vse storitve."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:108
msgid "(opt-out)"
msgstr "(odjava)"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:109
msgid "This service is loaded by default (but you can opt out)"
msgstr "Ta storitev je privzeto naložena (vendar se lahko odjavite)"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:112
msgid "(always required)"
msgstr "(vedno obvezno)"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:113
msgid "This services is always required"
msgstr "Te storitve so vedno potrebne"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:115
msgid "purposes:"
msgstr "nameni:"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:116
msgid "purpose:"
msgstr "namen:"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:118
msgid "Realized with Klaro!"
msgstr "Realizirano s Klaro!"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:120
msgid "Do you want to load external content supplied by {title}?"
msgstr "Ali želite naložiti zunanjo vsebino, ki jo zagotavlja {title}?"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:121
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Da"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:122
msgid "Always"
msgstr "Vedno"

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:134
msgid ""
"The cookies used by Galette do not store your personal data and do not track "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Piškotki, ki jih uporablja Galette, ne shranjujejo vaših osebnih podatkov in "
"vam ne sledijo."

#: ../templates/default/scripts.html.twig:140
msgid "Consent Manager"
msgstr "Urednik vsebin"
